  "label": "Anti-immigrant Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme uses the metaphor of sperm to imply that while many immigrants arrive, only one will succeed or be useful, which is a dehumanizing and harmful stereotype that reduces immigrants to biological statistics and reinforces xenophobic views. This stereotype is commonly used in political discourse to justify restrictive immigration policies and to portray immigrants as a burden or waste.",
